                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Fastrack's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Youth-forward positioning + Titan + Tata parent backing + broad category expansion + digital transformation success. Multi-dimensional legacy-plus-D2C advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new watch brands compete with Fastrack?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific niching (premium youth, smart watch specialty, sustainability-focused, ethnic/traditional watches). Category continues evolving.</p>
                                        <h3>Can legacy brands successfully do D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with sustained investment + cultural adaptation. Fastrack + Titan + Marico + HUL all demonstrate legacy-brand D2C transformation success.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest legacy brand D2C lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Sustained digital investment + youth-marketing cultural adaptation + parent advantages leveraged combined. Not automatic — requires deliberate transformation.</p>
